    "text": "W1 = \n32\n * 3 * 3 * 3 \n/ 1024 = 0.84375\nB1 = 32 * 4 / 1024 = 0.125\nWd2 = 32 * 3 * 3 / 1024 = 0.28125\nBd2 = \n32 * 4 / 1024 = 0.125\nY1 = 7 * 63 * 32 / 1024 = 13.78125\n发送\n7\n * \n28\n * \n32\nYd2p = 7 * \n28\n * 32 * 4 / 1024 = \n24.5\n计算\n9\n次\n求部分和\n最终得到的结果经过\nReLU\nYd2 = 7 * 28 * 32 / 1024 = 6.125\n发回\n7\n * \n28\n * \n32\nW2 = 1 * 1 * 32 * 64 = 2\nB2 = 64 * 4 / 1024 = 0.25\nBuffer\n \n=\n \n1\n * \n56\n * \n32\n * \n4\n \n/\n \n1024\n \n=\n \n7\nY\n2\n \n=\n \n7\n * \n56\n * \n64\n \n/\n \n1024\n \n=\n \n24.5\n \nWfc\n = 1024 * 32 / 1024 = 32\nBfc\n = 32 * 4 / 1024 = 0.125",
